	<item>
		<title>BrickLink LEGO Marketplace Back Online After Site Outage Due to Security Cyberattack/Hacking: November 2026</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/bricklink-lego-marketplace-back-online-after-site-outage-due-to-cyberattack-hacking-november-2026/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/bricklink-lego-marketplace-back-online-after-site-outage-due-to-cyberattack-hacking-november-2026/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 05:32:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114728</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1010" height="257" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Bricklink Banner Logo Ad Community Update LEGO Marketplace" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace.jpg 1010w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace-300x76.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace-768x195.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, 1010px" loading="lazy" /></p>
<p>BrickLink is a popular secondary LEGO marketplace that is owned and operated by LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124;</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/bricklink-lego-marketplace-back-online-after-site-outage-due-to-cyberattack-hacking-november-2026/">BrickLink LEGO Marketplace Back Online After Site Outage Due to Security Cyberattack/Hacking: November 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>BrickLink is a popular secondary LEGO marketplace that is owned and operated by LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). The site was offline for many days and has only recently went back online. Many people use this LEGO marketplace for their livelihoods where they resell LEGO (i.e Sets, Minifigures, Parts, Instructions, etc). Many have went to alternatives like at eBay (<a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.com USA</a> | <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay.ca Canada</a>) during this timeframe.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114729 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace.jpg" alt="" width="1010" height="257" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace.jpg 1010w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace-300x76.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Banner-Logo-Ad-Community-Update-LEGO-Marketplace-768x195.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, 1010px" /></p>
<p>BrickLink has now announced the reason why they went offline after &#8220;identifying unusual activity&#8221;. They claim that certain emails, usernames and IP addresses were accessed. BrickLink wanted to investigate and contain the issue before bringing the site back online.</p>
<p>Due to the disruption and inconvenience, BrickLink will be waiving all seller fees for the months of November and December 2026. Sellers won&#8217;t get any invoices during these months. Below is the official Bricklink statement regarding the Cyberattack/Hacking security issue.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114730 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Site-Outage-November-2026-CyberAttack-Hacked-Offline.jpg" alt="" width="1218" height="903" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Site-Outage-November-2026-CyberAttack-Hacked-Offline.jpg 1218w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Site-Outage-November-2026-CyberAttack-Hacked-Offline-300x222.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Site-Outage-November-2026-CyberAttack-Hacked-Offline-1024x759.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bricklink-Site-Outage-November-2026-CyberAttack-Hacked-Offline-768x569.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1218px) 100vw, 1218px" /></p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any LEGO Deals or News by subscribing to our email list!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are <span style="text-decoration: underline;">no ads</span> in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="550" height="439" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 550px) 100vw, 550px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases made. Please ensure to accept the merchant&#8217;s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
