		<item>
		<title>[Canada] Amazon Launches Limited Time LEGO Deals on November 12, 2026 (Over 25 Sets Discounted)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-amazon-launches-limited-time-lego-deals-on-november-12-2026-over-25-sets-discounted/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-amazon-launches-limited-time-lego-deals-on-november-12-2026-over-25-sets-discounted/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 04:17:03 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
