		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114722</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="958" height="924" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Amazon Canada LEGO November 12, 2026 Limited Time Sales &amp; Deals List" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 958w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-768x741.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 958px) 100vw, 958px" /></p>
<p>Happy Thursday Evening Canadian LEGO Fans! Amazon Canada now has now launched over 25 limited time LEGO deals.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-amazon-launches-limited-time-lego-deals-on-november-12-2026-over-25-sets-discounted/">[Canada] Amazon Launches Limited Time LEGO Deals on November 12, 2026 (Over 25 Sets Discounted)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?k=lego&amp;rh=p_n_deal_type%3A23565506011&amp;dc=&amp;ds=v1%3Ag5EPme5PU7G5yVAM3nt%2FTH0tcfKTVMa62LuzOs15apA&amp;crid=2TW3N2FMMYP3J&amp;qid=1794542905&amp;rnid=23565505011&amp;sprefix=%2Caps%2C521&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=9cf0944cfa2b959ffa90ccd3231b2dc2&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114723 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-3.jpg" alt="" width="960" height="852" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-3.jpg 960w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-3-300x266.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-3-768x682.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px" /></a></p>
<p>Happy Thursday Evening Canadian LEGO Fans! <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> now has now launched <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?k=lego&amp;rh=p_n_deal_type%3A23565506011&amp;dc=&amp;ds=v1%3Ag5EPme5PU7G5yVAM3nt%2FTH0tcfKTVMa62LuzOs15apA&amp;crid=2TW3N2FMMYP3J&amp;qid=1794542905&amp;rnid=23565505011&amp;sprefix=%2Caps%2C521&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=a7dec026e3ca65de6721bf6d0d164c29&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 25 limited time LEGO deals</a>. Its most likely to compete with the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fshop%2Fblack-friday-early-deals%2F1356285316422%3FcatId%3D10011%26facet%3Dretailer_type%253AWalmart%257C%257Cbrand%253ALEGO" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026</a> which we mentioned yesterday in another article <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-early-black-friday-2026-deals-now-live-9-sets-discounted/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over here</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?k=lego&amp;rh=p_n_deal_type%3A23565506011&amp;dc=&amp;ds=v1%3Ag5EPme5PU7G5yVAM3nt%2FTH0tcfKTVMa62LuzOs15apA&amp;crid=2TW3N2FMMYP3J&amp;qid=1794542905&amp;rnid=23565505011&amp;sprefix=%2Caps%2C521&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=9cf0944cfa2b959ffa90ccd3231b2dc2&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114725 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-2.jpg" alt="" width="937" height="852" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-2.jpg 937w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-2-300x273.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-2-768x698.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 937px) 100vw, 937px" /></a></p>
<p>My favourite deal would probably be the <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Gingerbread-Christmas-Decoration-Imaginative/dp/B0G2T2Q1RH?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=a9c653c1aedd468c57743740fc19905f&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Festive Gingerbread House 40809</a> at 20% off for<strong> $39.99</strong> (reg.$49.99). A nice little set for the Christmas holidays! Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?k=lego&amp;rh=p_n_deal_type%3A23565506011&amp;dc=&amp;ds=v1%3Ag5EPme5PU7G5yVAM3nt%2FTH0tcfKTVMa62LuzOs15apA&amp;crid=2TW3N2FMMYP3J&amp;qid=1794542905&amp;rnid=23565505011&amp;sprefix=%2Caps%2C521&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=9cf0944cfa2b959ffa90ccd3231b2dc2&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114724 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List.jpg" alt="" width="958" height="924" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List.jpg 958w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Amazon-Canada-LEGO-November-12-2026-Limited-Time-Sales-Deals-List-768x741.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 958px) 100vw, 958px" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
