										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Seven new Disney Lucasfilm LEGO Star Wars January 2027 sets have been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). We&#8217;ll look at the release dates, US/Canada prices, set images and more in this article!</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when these LEGO Star Wars January 2027 sets becomes available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114676 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1122" height="1043" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x279.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x952.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x714.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1122px) 100vw, 1122px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75495 Stormtrooper (Concept Art) Helmet</li>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75482 Up-Scaled Luke Skywalker Minifigure</li>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75480 Duel on Bespin</li>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75478 Rebel Y-Wing Starfighter</li>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75470 Mustafar Duel</li>
<li>LEGO Star Wars 75466 Darth Vader 2 in 1 Wall Art</li>
<li>LEGO ART Star Wars 75467 A New Hope Movie Poster</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114660 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1002" height="1002" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-ART-Star-Wars-75467-A-New-Hope-Movie-Poster-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1002px) 100vw, 1002px" /></p>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h2><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Seven Upcoming LEGO Star Wars January 2027 Sets Revealed: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Set Images</span></h2>
<h3>75495 Stormtrooper (Concept Art) Helmet January 2027</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $79.99 USD / $109.99 CAD / £69.99 GBP / $119.99 AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 18+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 832</li>
<li>Official Release Date: January 1, 2027</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
