		<title>10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 11, 2026</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-11-2026/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-11-2026/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:51:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114612</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1007" height="835" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Creator 31129 3 in 1 Majestic Tiger January Winter 2022 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1007w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x249.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x637.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1007px) 100vw, 1007px" /></p>
<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/10-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-11-2026/">10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 11, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-68626 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1004" height="833" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1004w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x249.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/LEGO-Creator-31129-3-in-1-Majestic-Tiger-January-Winter-2022-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x637.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1004px) 100vw, 1004px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals include the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Super-Mario-Collectible-Birthdays/dp/B0DJ19P6PW?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=879bec303f0b111f7f989b3788e17879&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Super Mario: Mario Kart Baby Peach &amp; Grand Prix Set 72036</a> at 23% off for <strong>$61.82</strong> (reg.$79.99). I also think the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Majestic-Building-Featuring-Imaginative/dp/B09FM57L7B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=84957a396e7904d08eb5f8d31b1d1235&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Majestic Tiger 31129</a> at 40% off for <strong>$29.99</strong> (reg.$49.99) is a great deal. Note that this set actual regular price is $49.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a> even though Amazon has a lower regular price. In addition, the set is now listed as sold out on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>.</p>
