					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="853" height="843" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Disney Frozen 43278 Mini Arendelle Castle &amp; Elsa&#039;s Ice Palace June 2025 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 853w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x759.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px" /></p>
<p>Wal-Mart Canada Online LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Sales &#38; Deals will be starting soon later tonight at</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/canada-wal-mart-lego-early-black-friday-2026-deals-november-12-18/">[Canada] Wal-Mart LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Deals: November 12-18</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> LEGO Early Black Friday 2026 Sales &amp; Deals will be starting soon later tonight at 12am ET (in a few more hours). Sale runs from November 12-18, 2026 or while supplies last. On their flyer, they have advertised three LEGO sets on sale. However, there may potentially be unadvertised deals. Hopefully, there are more.</p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Wal-Mart Canada Early LEGO Black Friday Deals 2026 &#8211; Advertised on Flyer</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>44% off &#8211; LEGO DUPLO Town 3 in 1 Animals on Wheels 10448 <strong>$24.86</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
<li>39% off &#8211; LEGO Disney Frozen Mini Arendelle Castle &amp; Elsa’s Ice Palace 43278 <strong>$39.86</strong> (reg.$64.99) &#8211;<em> Online only</em></li>
<li>33% off &#8211; LEGO Horizon Adventures Aloy &amp; Varl vs. Shell-Walker &amp; Sawtooth 77037 <strong>$39.86</strong> (reg.$59.99) &#8211;<em> Online only</em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96594 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="853" height="843" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 853w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43278-Mini-Arendelle-Castle-Elsas-Ice-Palace-June-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x759.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92315 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-Horizon-Adventures-77037-Aloy-Varl-vs.-Shell-Walker-Sawtooth-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1075" height="862" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-Horizon-Adventures-77037-Aloy-Varl-vs.-Shell-Walker-Sawtooth-Front-Box.jpg 1075w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-Horizon-Adventures-77037-Aloy-Varl-vs.-Shell-Walker-Sawtooth-Front-Box-300x241.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-Horizon-Adventures-77037-Aloy-Varl-vs.-Shell-Walker-Sawtooth-Front-Box-1024x821.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/LEGO-Horizon-Adventures-77037-Aloy-Varl-vs.-Shell-Walker-Sawtooth-Front-Box-768x616.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1075px) 100vw, 1075px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-96743 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="852" height="862" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 852w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-297x300.jpg 297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Duplo-10448-3in1-Animals-on-Wheels-Summer-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x777.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px" /></p>
<p>*<strong>More great LEGO sales buys can be found on the <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca%2Fen%2Fsearch%3Fq%3Dlego%26facet%3Dfacet_ss_BestSellers%253ABestSellers%257C%257Cretailer_type%253AWalmart%26affinityOverride%3Ddefault" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Bestsellers List</a>. </strong>Make sure to filter the seller to Wal-Mart Canada (and not third party sellers) and choose Best Selling Items.</p>
<p>We also have a <strong><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricksforum.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="843" height="673" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases. <em>Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. </em>Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
