		<item>
		<title>Reminder: LEGO Stores US &#038; Canada FREE Reindeer Holiday Make &#038; Take on November 13, 2026 and Insiders Private Shopping Event on November 15, 2026</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/reminder-lego-stores-us-canada-free-reindeer-holiday-make-take-on-november-13-2026-and-insiders-private-shopping-event-on-november-15-2026/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/reminder-lego-stores-us-canada-free-reindeer-holiday-make-take-on-november-13-2026-and-insiders-private-shopping-event-on-november-15-2026/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Ice]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:19:02 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks Sales]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Events]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales & Deals]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales Canada]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Sales US]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO Store]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114604</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1280" height="720" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Store Make &amp; Take Event November 13, 2026 - Reindeer Holiday Christmas" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" /></p>
<p>As a friendly reminder, LEGO Stores (US &#124; Canada) will be having some pretty cool events coming up in a</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/reminder-lego-stores-us-canada-free-reindeer-holiday-make-take-on-november-13-2026-and-insiders-private-shopping-event-on-november-15-2026/">Reminder: LEGO Stores US &#038; Canada FREE Reindeer Holiday Make &#038; Take on November 13, 2026 and Insiders Private Shopping Event on November 15, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>As a friendly reminder, LEGO Stores (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a>) will be having some pretty cool events coming up in a few days. We mentioned the Reindeer Make &amp; Take <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/free-lego-store-make-take-event-on-november-13-2026-reindeer-holiday-us-canada-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">back on November 2, 2026</a>. and the Insiders Private Shopping Event <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-store-insiders-private-shopping-event-on-november-15-2026-us-canada-reservations-required/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">back on September 16, 2026</a>.</p>
<p>The FREE LEGO Reindeer Holiday Christmas Make &amp; Take event will be happening at LEGO Stores (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a>). It will be on Friday, November 13, 2026 from 5-7pm. You do not need a reservation but it will be on a first come first serve basis.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114088 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas.jpg" alt="" width="1127" height="634" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Store-Make-Take-Event-November-13-2026-Reindeer-Holiday-Christmas-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1127px) 100vw, 1127px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Store Reindeer (FREE Make &amp; Take Event) &#8211; Friday, November 13, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>USA &amp; Canada Only: </strong>Friday, November 13, 2026 from 5-7pm</li>
</ul>
<p>Note that there are limited quantities for the LEGO Make &amp; Take Builds. You cannot buy these Make &amp; Take builds directly. <strong>A few LEGO Stores may offer the building event on a different day/time.</strong> To avoid disappointment, we recommend calling your physical LEGO Brand Retail Store to confirm availability as well as to see if any reservations are required. To find the nearest official physical LEGO Store in your region, you can check the LEGO Store pages here: <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">LEGO Store Insiders Private Shopping Event &#8211; Sunday, November 15, 2026</span></h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-84352 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/LEGO-Insiders-Logo-August-2023-Rebrand-from-LEGO-VIP-Rewards.jpg" alt="" width="569" height="149" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/LEGO-Insiders-Logo-August-2023-Rebrand-from-LEGO-VIP-Rewards.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/LEGO-Insiders-Logo-August-2023-Rebrand-from-LEGO-VIP-Rewards-300x79.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/LEGO-Insiders-Logo-August-2023-Rebrand-from-LEGO-VIP-Rewards-1024x268.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/LEGO-Insiders-Logo-August-2023-Rebrand-from-LEGO-VIP-Rewards-768x201.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 569px) 100vw, 569px" /></p>
<p>In addition, there will be a <strong>Insiders Private Shopping Event</strong> on <strong>Sunday, November 15, 2026</strong> at LEGO Stores (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a>). You need a reservation but do note that most spots have already been booked and taken. There may still be a few more spots available though depending on your store. Reservation links can be made at the official LEGO Store page: <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fstores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-112787 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Insiders-Private-Shopping-Event-Banner-Logo-Sale.jpg" alt="" width="1060" height="596" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Insiders-Private-Shopping-Event-Banner-Logo-Sale.jpg 1280w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Insiders-Private-Shopping-Event-Banner-Logo-Sale-300x169.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Insiders-Private-Shopping-Event-Banner-Logo-Sale-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/LEGO-Insiders-Private-Shopping-Event-Banner-Logo-Sale-768x432.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1060px) 100vw, 1060px" /></p>
<p>As mentioned earlier, we did mention this Insiders Private Shopping event <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-store-insiders-private-shopping-event-on-november-15-2026-us-canada-reservations-required/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">back on September 16, 2026</a>. To ensure you don&#8217;t miss out on any LEGO News or Deals, we recommend following us by subscribing to our free email newsletter.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-52719 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping.jpg" alt="" width="641" height="359" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping.jpg 744w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/LEGO-Brand-Retail-Store-Shopping-300x168.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 641px) 100vw, 641px" /></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="671" height="339" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 671px) 100vw, 671px" /></p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="721" height="576" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 721px) 100vw, 721px" /></p>
<p>Disclosure Integrity &amp; Transparency: This post contains affiliate links. Toys N Bricks earns from qualifying purchases made. Please ensure to accept the merchant’s 3rd party cookies (if there are any) and disable any browser extensions (if there are any) so that the affiliate link works. Thank you for your support in the work that we do here.</p>
