										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> currently has a few LEGO deals for this afternoon for November 11, 2026.</p>
<p>Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a few of the sets. But we did check them with <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> and calculated the actual savings percentage for your convenience. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t miss out on any future LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in Canada by subscribing to our email list.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">7 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 11, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>30% off &#8211; 18+ LEGO IDEAS 21349 Tuxedo Cat<strong> $91.18</strong> (reg.$129.99)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-89423 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="473" height="735" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 473w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-193x300.jpg 193w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 473px) 100vw, 473px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-89424 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="568" height="878" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 568w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/18-LEGO-IDEAS-21349-Tuxedo-Cat-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Back-Box-194x300.jpg 194w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 568px) 100vw, 568px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>24% off &#8211; LEGO Creator 3in1 Turtle with a Water Lily Flower 31377<strong> $9.86</strong> (reg.$12.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; 18+ LEGO Star Wars: Attack of the Clones Yoda Bust 75438 <strong>$39.86</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106066 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75438-Yoda-Bust-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="757" height="785" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75438-Yoda-Bust-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 814w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75438-Yoda-Bust-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-289x300.jpg 289w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18-LEGO-Star-Wars-75438-Yoda-Bust-April-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x796.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 757px) 100vw, 757px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103026 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="862" height="845" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 862w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31377-Turtle-with-a-Water-Lily-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x753.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 862px) 100vw, 862px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>22% off &#8211; LEGO Botanicals Flowering Cactus 11509<strong> $34.86</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; LEGO Bluey Grannies with Bingo and Bluey 11216 <strong>$15.86</strong> (reg.$19.99)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107899 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1055" height="1055" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Bluey-11216-Grannies-with-Bingo-and-Bluey-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1055px) 100vw, 1055px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101908 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11059-Flowering-Cactus-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="855" height="839" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11059-Flowering-Cactus-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 855w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11059-Flowering-Cactus-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11059-Flowering-Cactus-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x754.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 855px) 100vw, 855px" /></p>
<ul>
